            <run bold='true' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='13'>Two programmes, eight jurisdictions, 2024-25</run><run>Æ&#10;</run><run fontcolor='#52514e' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='10' italic='true'>South Australia leads on both. The Northern Territory: 18.8 per 1,000 in residential care.</run>
